msgstr "Passwortänderung für Dofus Fashionista angefordert"

#: chardata/login_view.py:171
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A password reset has been requested for The Dofus Fashionista!\n"
"Your username is: {username}\n"
"Please click the link below to generate a new one for your account.\n"
"{link}\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want to reset your password, just ignore this email."
