"Unterschiede zwischen Dofus 3, Beta, Dofus 2, Retro und Touch."

msgid ""
"Short, no-nonsense guides for getting the most out of the Fashionista, and "
"out of your Dofus characters. No fluff, just the stuff that actually changes"
" your build."
msgstr ""
"Kurze, ehrliche Guides, um das Maximum aus der Fashionista (und aus deinen "
